<title>JAPAN: Chugai Mining - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chugai Mining - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.11		vs	    2.09</p>
<p> Operating	   15 million	 vs	   71 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 382 million	 vs   loss 620 million</p>
